//SYSTEM ALERT: INTAKE OFFLINE

//DIAGNOSTIC: The reactor’s intake system is blocked because it can’t identify the main pollutant it’s supposed to capture. The sensors are confused. You need to figure out what the reactor needs to capture.

//ACTION REQUIRED: There is a hidden message for you that can help you.

//SYSTEM ALERT: SORTING ALGORITHMS OFFLINE

//DIAGNOSTIC: The molecular disassembly chamber is malfunctioning; the lasers can't target the CO2 to decompose if it doesn't know the sources of the CO2. To calibrate the laser system, you must identify the hidden costs different categories have in our environment.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Sort the following molecular compounds into their correct categories to restore automated classification.

//SYSTEM ALERT: LASER ALIGNMENTS OFFLINE

//DIAGNOSTIC: At the power plant control room, there’s an energy leak happening because some machines are still drawing power even though they're not running properly.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Students have to spot the machines that are leaking phantom energy and identify the cause.

//SYSTEM ALERT: Nuclear Energy Core offline.

//DIAGNOSTIC: The recycling center's sorting machine is broken!
You need to manually sort the trash into the correct bins before the pile overflows.


//ACTION REQUIRED: Match each item to the right recycling bin. Act fast — the planet is counting on you!

//SYSTEM ALERT: Isotopic Reformation chamber malfunction.

//DIAGNOSTIC: Welcome delegates. Following the summit, your team must identify key national challenges and align with global solutions. 

//ACTION REQUIRED: Decode the final action phrase to complete your mission!

//SYSTEM ALERT: Cryogenic Water Recycling system failure.

//DIAGNOSTIC: From heaven's tears to your daily needs, Some choices drain more than others indeed. To unlock the secrets that I withhold, Arrange nature's thirst from large to small.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Enter the right order of cards in this format ITEM1-ITEM2-ITEM3...

//SYSTEM ALERT: Synthetic Product Breakdown unit malfunction.

//DIAGNOSTIC: There’s more to the branded products on the table than meets the eye. Some of them are lying and has hidden messaging.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Enter the right message that exposes these products.

//SYSTEM ALERT: Closed-loop Energy Distribution network failure.

//DIAGNOSTIC: The generator is down and must be rebooted! You need to gain access to the central control server to fix the generator. The engineers have gone, but they left a note on the table.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Decode the message and enter the words with the "=" in between.

//SYSTEM ALERT: Waste Reclamation & Reactor Cooling system failure.

//DIAGNOSTIC: Graphene-based thermal recapture system overheating. Water purification units offline.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Enter thermal regulation sequence to restore heat dissipation.

//SYSTEM ALERT: AI-Controlled Ecosystem Balance system offline.

//DIAGNOSTIC: Central AI core processing error. Environmental monitoring interrupted.

//ACTION REQUIRED: Enter AI reboot sequence with administrator credentials to restore ecosystem monitoring.
